  "body": "Step through the front door and the wide hallway sets the pace: light, unhurried and easy.\r\n\r\nIt opens to a spacious kitchen, dining and family room that flows out to the garden, with a butler's pantry keeping everyday mess out of sight. On a generous 680m² freehold section, the landscaped garden is well established and the home is low maintenance, so your weekends stay yours.\r\n\r\nThere are four bedrooms, including a master with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe. A separate study and a second lounge give the family room to spread out, and there's a big family bathroom and a separate laundry. Double glazing and a heat pump keep it comfortable through the seasons.\r\n\r\nSet in a quiet pocket of Millwater, with the motorway on/off ramp close by, the commute is easy.\r\n\r\nThe vendors are motivated and will consider all reasonable offers. Call Amy and Jonas for viewing. Co-operating agents are welcome to enquire.\r\n\r\nFloor area 225m² | Land 680m² | 4 bedrooms + Study | 2 living areas\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
